IMPORTANT DISCLAIMER FOR INDUSTRIAL USE:

This software is provided for educational and research purposes. When deploying
in industrial production environments:

1. Conduct thorough security assessments and penetration testing
2. Follow applicable safety standards (IEC 62443, ISO 27001, etc.)
3. Implement proper change management procedures
4. Ensure compliance with local regulations and industry standards
5. Perform adequate backup and disaster recovery testing
6. Train personnel on secure coding and operational practices

The contributors and maintainers of this project assume no liability for any
damages, losses, or safety incidents resulting from the use of this software
in production industrial control systems.

All modifications to industrial control systems should be reviewed and approved
by qualified safety engineers and comply with applicable safety standards.
